00:05:23.399 --> 00:05:27.079
And again, we understand that we now have the whole canon of Scripture.

00:05:27.079 --> 00:05:33.040
But I want you to notice as you go through these few verses of Scripture that God reveals

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:36.799
to us what the Scripture is called.

00:05:36.799 --> 00:05:38.440
