00:08:55.919 --> 00:08:56.919
Because he loved us.

00:08:56.919 --> 00:09:02.760
And we begin to understand the Scriptures and how thankful we are for how God has provided

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:05.219
to us this truth in verse number seven.

00:09:05.219 --> 00:09:10.940
He continues in verse number seven and says, the testimony of the Lord is sure.

